---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
import { FOUNDED, GEAR } from '../data/business';
---

<Page title="About" description="Meet Reliable Kev, the person behind Sixth Sense Studios in North Jersey.">
  <h1>About Sixth Sense Studios</h1>
  <figure class="pull">
    <blockquote>Kev is at his best with a camera and in the chair.</blockquote>
    <figcaption>Vinny, owner of One Brick Media</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <p>
    Sixth Sense Studios is the video studio of Reliable Kev, filming across{' '}
    <a href="/where-i-work">{SITE.area}</a> since {FOUNDED}. I film monthly content, business owner podcasts, events and brand films for
    towns, downtowns, local businesses and trade companies.
  </p>


  <h2>Full context storytelling</h2>
  <p>
    I put the time, the care and the thought behind not only listening to your story, but directing and creating what
    is there. Trust is the most valuable thing a business has, and people want to see who they are hiring before they
    call. So I don't just film the product. I tell three stories in every story:
  </p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>The business.</strong> What you make, how you work, and why customers keep coming back.</li>
    <li><strong>The owner.</strong> Your story, in your words, so people know who they are buying from.</li>
    <li><strong>The town.</strong> The street, the neighbors, the community you are part of.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who I work with</h2>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li>Towns and municipalities showing residents what is being built, fixed and planned</li>
    <li>Downtowns and chambers of commerce that want people walking their streets</li>
    <li>Local shops, restaurants and services</li>
    <li>Trades and contractors: concrete, construction, landscaping and more</li>
  </ul>

  {/* Community section returns once Kev shares the local work he does. */}

  <h2>The gear</h2>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li>{GEAR.cameras}, so interviews and podcasts are covered from two angles</li>
    <li>{GEAR.support}</li>
    <li>{GEAR.drone} for aerial footage</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Our standards for quality</h2>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li>A plan before every shoot, so nothing is wasted</li>
    <li>Respect for your time, your crew and your customers on shoot day</li>
    <li>Clean edits delivered on schedule, ready to post</li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/contact#quote">Book a free call</a> and let's talk about your story.</p>
</Page>

<style>
  .pull { margin: 8px 0 32px; padding: 4px 0 4px 24px; border-left: 3px solid var(--text); }
  .pull blockquote { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.6vw, 1.75rem); line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
  .pull blockquote::before { content: '\201C'; }
  .pull blockquote::after { content: '\201D'; }
  .pull figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .photo { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: grid; place-items: center; margin: 28px 0; }
</style>
